<title>FRANCE: Elf extends Angola oil discovery.</title>
<headline>Elf extends Angola oil discovery.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French oil company Elf Aquitaine said on Tuesday it had struck oil at a second tier in the Girassol field offshore Angola and that tests had confirmed the deep sea oil field's production potential.</p>
<p>Appraisal well Girassol 2A, drilled down to 1,300 metres (4,265 feet), confirmed the existence of a reservoir announced in April 1996 and also tapped a new, deeper, reservoir bringing cumulative test production to 18,000 barrels per day (bpd), it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
